Description:
Utilizes the following formula – checks the following values of the UTM in order (returns BLANK if empty): Source | Medium | Campaign | Term | Content. 

When UTM is NULL returns Organic Search Platform 
OR the Drill Down result of Original Source
---
if(is_known([properties.utm_source]), 
concatenate(if(is_known([properties.utm_source]), [properties.utm_source], ""), 
" | ", 
if(is_known([properties.utm_medium]), [properties.utm_medium], ""), 
" | ", 
if(is_known([properties.utm_campaign]), [properties.utm_campaign], ""), 
" | ", 
if(is_known([properties.utm_term]), [properties.utm_term], ""), 
" | ", 
if(is_known([properties.utm_content]), [properties.utm_content], "")), 

if(contains([properties.hs_analytics_source], "Organic Search"), 
[properties.hs_analytics_source_data_2], 
[properties.hs_analytics_source_data_1]
)
)
